      "html": "<ul><li>A tower survey covers three things: structure, safe access and antennas.</li><li>Work at height falls under the Work at Height Regulations 2005. Lifting gear used on the climb falls under LOLER 1998.</li><li>No single law sets the report format. Follow the operator's spec.</li><li>Record each fault with a photo at the point you see it.</li><li>You still judge each fault. Quickler writes it up.</li></ul>"
    },
